:: collect data {"position":"1200,225","size":"100,100"}
Over time, you accumulate substantial evidence that demonstrates the negative impact of the feature on customer satisfaction and accessibility. Armed with this data, you prepare to present your findings to the manager or the press.

[[Go to your manager -> Manager]]

[[Go to the press -> Press]]



